{"title":"Calendar & Key Dates","markdown":{"yaml":{"format":"pdf","execute":{"echo":false,"warning":false,"message":false},"title-block-style":"plain","date-modified":"last-modified"},"headingText":"Calendar & Key Dates","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n```{r}\n\nlibrary(kableExtra)\nlibrary(tidyverse)\n\ncalendar <- read_csv(\"./schedule.csv\") %>% \n  mutate(WEEK=paste(Week1,WEEK,sep=\" \")) %>% \n  select(-block,-Week1) %>% \n  mutate(DATE=paste(Day,Month,sep=\"-\")) %>% \n  # mutate(SESSION=as.character(SESSION)) %>% \n  select(WEEK,DATE,TOPIC, `ASSIGNMENT INFO`=`ASSIGNMENT DISTRIBUTED or DUE`) %>% \n  # select(WEEK,SESSION,DATE,TOPIC, `ASSIGNMENT INFO`=`ASSIGNMENT DISTRIBUTED or DUE`) %>% \n  replace_na(list(DATE=\"\",WEEK=\"\", TOPIC=\"\", `ASSIGNMENT INFO`=\"\")) %>% \n  mutate(WEEK = gsub(\"NA NA\",\"\", WEEK)) %>% \n  mutate(WEEK = gsub(\"Finals Week NA\",\"Finals Week\", WEEK)) \n\n# %>% \n#   mutate(WEEK = gsub(\"NA Final Exam\",\"\", WEEK))\n# \n# calendar$DATE <- gsub(\"NA-NA\",\"\", calendar$DATE)\n# calendar$WEEK <- gsub(\"NA Final Exam\",\"\", calendar$WEEK)\n\n# names(calendar) <- c(\"\",\"\",\"\")\n\nkable(calendar,\n      # digits = 2,\n      align=\"cclr\",\n      # format=\"latex\",\n      # format=\"html\",\n      row.names = FALSE,\n      escape= TRUE,\n      booktabs=T,\n      linesep = \"\",\n      # caption = \"Semester Overview and Key Dates\"\n) %>% \n  # kable_styling(font_size = 50) %>%\n  gsub(\"font-size: initial !important;\",\n       \"font-size: 50pt !important;\",\n        .) %>% \n  column_spec(1, bold = F, border_right = T) %>%\n  row_spec(seq(2,32,by=2),hline_after = TRUE) %>% \n  # row_spec(seq(8,16,by=2),hline_after = TRUE) %>% \n  # column_spec(2, width = \"5em\", background = \"white\",border_right = T) %>%\n  pack_rows(\"WHY ARE WE FASCINATED BY TROPICAL RAIN FORESTS?\", 1, 6,label_row_css = \"background-color: white; color: #1F691B\") %>%\n  pack_rows(\"THE ECOLOGY & EVOLUTION OF TROPICAL RAIN FORESTS\",7,16,label_row_css = \"background-color: white; color: #1F691B\") %>%\n  pack_rows(\"THE DRIVERS AND IMPACTS OF DEFORESTATION\", 17, 22,label_row_css = \"background-color: white; color: #1F691B\") %>%\n  pack_rows(\"THE FUTURE OF TROPICAL RAIN FORESTS\", 23, 31,label_row_css = \"background-color: white; color: #1F691B\") %>%\n  \n  \n  \n  # pack_rows(\"Finals Week\", 49, 49) %>%\n  kable_styling(\n#     bootstrap_options = c(\"hover\"),\n     # full_width = T,\n     latex_options= c(\"scale_down\",\"HOLD_position\"),\n     font_size = 9,\nposition = \"left\") %>% \ncolumn_spec(1, width = \"8em\") %>%\n# column_spec(2, width = \"1em\") %>%\ncolumn_spec(2, width = \"7em\") %>%\ncolumn_spec(3, width = \"25em\") %>%\ncolumn_spec(4, width = \"18em\") %>%\n  column_spec(4, bold=T) %>%\n  column_spec(1, bold=T) %>%\n  # row_spec(49, bold=T) %>%\n  row_spec(0, bold = T, color = \"white\", background = \"#1F691B\") \n  \n```\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n# Calendar & Key Dates  \n```{r}\n\nlibrary(kableExtra)\nlibrary(tidyverse)\n\ncalendar <- read_csv(\"./schedule.csv\") %>% \n  mutate(WEEK=paste(Week1,WEEK,sep=\" \")) %>% \n  select(-block,-Week1) %>% \n  mutate(DATE=paste(Day,Month,sep=\"-\")) %>% \n  # mutate(SESSION=as.character(SESSION)) %>% \n  select(WEEK,DATE,TOPIC, `ASSIGNMENT INFO`=`ASSIGNMENT DISTRIBUTED or DUE`) %>% \n  # select(WEEK,SESSION,DATE,TOPIC, `ASSIGNMENT INFO`=`ASSIGNMENT DISTRIBUTED or DUE`) %>% \n  replace_na(list(DATE=\"\",WEEK=\"\", TOPIC=\"\", `ASSIGNMENT INFO`=\"\")) %>% \n  mutate(WEEK = gsub(\"NA NA\",\"\", WEEK)) %>% \n  mutate(WEEK = gsub(\"Finals Week NA\",\"Finals Week\", WEEK)) \n\n# %>% \n#   mutate(WEEK = gsub(\"NA Final Exam\",\"\", WEEK))\n# \n# calendar$DATE <- gsub(\"NA-NA\",\"\", calendar$DATE)\n# calendar$WEEK <- gsub(\"NA Final Exam\",\"\", calendar$WEEK)\n\n# names(calendar) <- c(\"\",\"\",\"\")\n\nkable(calendar,\n      # digits = 2,\n      align=\"cclr\",\n      # format=\"latex\",\n      # format=\"html\",\n      row.names = FALSE,\n      escape= TRUE,\n      booktabs=T,\n      linesep = \"\",\n      # caption = \"Semester Overview and Key Dates\"\n) %>% \n  # kable_styling(font_size = 50) %>%\n  gsub(\"font-size: initial !important;\",\n       \"font-size: 50pt !important;\",\n        .) %>% \n  column_spec(1, bold = F, border_right = T) %>%\n  row_spec(seq(2,32,by=2),hline_after = TRUE) %>% \n  # row_spec(seq(8,16,by=2),hline_after = TRUE) %>% \n  # column_spec(2, width = \"5em\", background = \"white\",border_right = T) %>%\n  pack_rows(\"WHY ARE WE FASCINATED BY TROPICAL RAIN FORESTS?\", 1, 6,label_row_css = \"background-color: white; color: #1F691B\") %>%\n  pack_rows(\"THE ECOLOGY & EVOLUTION OF TROPICAL RAIN FORESTS\",7,16,label_row_css = \"background-color: white; color: #1F691B\") %>%\n  pack_rows(\"THE DRIVERS AND IMPACTS OF DEFORESTATION\", 17, 22,label_row_css = \"background-color: white; color: #1F691B\") %>%\n  pack_rows(\"THE FUTURE OF TROPICAL RAIN FORESTS\", 23, 31,label_row_css = \"background-color: white; color: #1F691B\") %>%\n  \n  \n  \n  # pack_rows(\"Finals Week\", 49, 49) %>%\n  kable_styling(\n#     bootstrap_options = c(\"hover\"),\n     # full_width = T,\n     latex_options= c(\"scale_down\",\"HOLD_position\"),\n     font_size = 9,\nposition = \"left\") %>% \ncolumn_spec(1, width = \"8em\") %>%\n# column_spec(2, width = \"1em\") %>%\ncolumn_spec(2, width = \"7em\") %>%\ncolumn_spec(3, width = \"25em\") %>%\ncolumn_spec(4, width = \"18em\") %>%\n  column_spec(4, bold=T) %>%\n  column_spec(1, bold=T) %>%\n  # row_spec(49, bold=T) %>%\n  row_spec(0, bold = T, color = \"white\", background = \"#1F691B\") \n  \n```\n------------------------------------------------------------------------"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"ca